## App URLs

Callback and logout URLs live in each `src/env-*.ts`. They must match the app's origin exactly,
with no trailing slash.
{%- if poolSettings.environments contains "production" %}

Before the first production deploy, replace `https://example.com` in `src/env-production.ts` with
the deployed app's origin.
{%- endif %}
